@startuml
title Activity (Detailed) - Feedback Submission and Admin Visibility

start
:User opens Settings > Feedback;
:Choose feedback type\n(ISSUE / IMPROVEMENT / COMMENT);
:Write description and submit;
:System sends POST /api/feedback;

if (Input valid?) then (Yes)
  :Check user exists;
  if (User exists?) then (Yes)
    :Create feedback record in feedbacks table;
    :Trigger admin notification event;
    :Show success message to submitter;
    :Admins open feedback list (GET /api/feedback);
    :Admins review feedback details\nwith user info and timestamp;
  else (No)
    :Show "User not found";
  endif
else (No)
  :Show validation error\n(type/description/userId required);
endif

stop
@enduml
